        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Definition and milestones {.smaller background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Business model**: A business model describes the rationale of how an organization creates, delivers, and captures value.\n",
        "- Milestones in this century:\n",
        "  - **2004**: Alexander Osterwalder introduces the Business Model Canvas.\n",
        "  - **2010**: Business Model Generation book is published.\n",
        "  - **2015**: Business Model Navigator book is published.\n",
        "- Software\n",
        "  - [Business model navigator](https://businessmodelnavigator.com/){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "  - [Strategyzer's Business Model Canvas](https://www.strategyzer.com/library/the-business-model-canvas){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Business model canvas {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "![](figures/business_model_canvas.png){fig-align=center}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Business models extensions\n",
        "\n",
        "##  Tripple layer business model (Joyce and Paquin, 2016) {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "![](figures/Triple-Layered-Business-Model-Canvas-TLBMC-image-from-Joyce-and-Paquin-2016.png){fig-align=center}\n",
        "\n",
        "## Threebility (Gerlach, 2015) {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "![](figures/csm_mm1_Threebility_The_Sustainable_Business_Model_Canvas_03146e7333.png){fig-align=center}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.notes}\n",
        "- **Triple layer business model**: Focuses on the value proposition, value creation, and value capture layers.\n",
        "- **Threebility**: Adds a sustainability layer to the traditional Business Model Canvas.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## ProGlreg business model (2023) {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "![](figures/proGIreg_business_model_.png){fig-align=center}\n",
        "\n",
        "## ISO 59010 circular economy (2024) {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "![](figures/iso_59010_bm_circular_economy.png){fig-align=center}\n",
        "\n",
        "## Interviews and surveys following BS {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
