        "\n",
        "# MD demo example {background-image=\"figures/template_h1.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "## Value Proposition {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Increasing biodiversity**: Bringing back native species and improving wetlands through water management and the green hatchery.\n",
        "- **Climate Resilience**: Carbon sequestration and improving water quality.\n",
        "- **Sustainable Development in NBS**: Promoting  regenerative tourism, sports fisheries, and community involvement in restoration efforts.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Key Partners {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Croatian Waters (HRVODE)**: Hydrological works and floodplain restoration.\n",
        "- **University of Zagreb (UZ-FSB)**: Technology development and digital platform management.\n",
        "- **CEKOM**: Data collection and strategy development.\n",
        "- **Local and Regional Authorities**: Coordination of on-ground activities.\n",
        "- **NGOs and SMEs**: Supporting community engagement and eco-tourism.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Key Resources {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Natural Resources**: Wetlands and native fish species.\n",
        "- **Human Resources**: Biodiversity experts, local labor, and scientific researchers.\n",
        "- **Technological Resources**: Centralized data repository and monitoring tools.\n",
        "- **Financial Resources**: EU Horizon Europe funding.\n",
        "- **Green Hatchery Infrastructure**: Aquaculture systems with renewable energy sources.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Key Activities {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Hydrological Restoration**: Removing barriers and improving water flows.\n",
        "- **Green Hatchery Operations**: Cultivating native fish species.\n",
        "- **Biodiversity Monitoring**: Digital tools for tracking ecological health.\n",
        "- **Community Engagement**: Workshops, citizen science, and local job creation.\n",
        "- **Sustainable Aquaculture**: Long-term fishery management and economic development.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Customer Segments {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Local Communities**: Benefiting from restored ecosystems and new economic opportunities.\n",
        "- **Regional and National Authorities**: Supporting environmental and flood management policies?\n",
        "- **Environmental Agencies**: Using the DEMO as a model for wetland restoration.\n",
        "- **Regenerative tourism community**: Leveraging the restored ecosystems for sustainable tourism.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Channels {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Digital Platforms**: Website, social media (Facebook, YouTube), and newsletters.\n",
        "- **Community Events**: Workshops, and participatory monitoring.\n",
        "- **Printed Materials**: Flyers, posters, and press releases.\n",
        "- **International Conferences**: Sharing knowledge with the broader scientific and policy communities.\n",
        "- **Portal** - Centralized data repository and monitoring tools.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Revenue Streams {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Regenerative Tourism and Sports Fisheries**: Income from guided tours, fishing permits, and eco-lodging.\n",
        "- **Sustainable Aquaculture**: Sale of native fish species to local markets.\n",
        "- **Reed and Plant Harvesting**: Sustainable use of wetland plants for bio-based materials.\n",
        "- **Environmental Consulting**: Offering expertise in wetland restoration to other regions.\n",
        "- **Data API** - subscriptoin on the portal?\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Cost Structure {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Restoration Costs**: Hydrological engineering, hatchery operations, and maintenance.\n",
        "- **Technology and Monitoring**: Sensors, drones, and data management systems.\n",
        "- **Community Engagement**: Workshops, educational programs, and local involvement.\n",
        "- **Project Management**: Administrative costs, legal compliance, and project coordination.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Data and tools for dynamic reporting and interactivity\n",
        "\n",
        "## Data Used in Business Model Preparation {background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Environmental Data** - water quality, biodiversity indicators, carbon sequestration data.\n",
        "- **Socio-economic Data** - macro data, local employment, business subject dynamics.\n",
        "- **Community and Stakeholder Feedback** - community surveys, interviews.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Data Science principles {.smaller background-image=\"figures/template_5.jpg\"}\n",
        "- **Dynamic** - automatic updates when new data is ingested or parameters are changed.\n",
        "- **Interactive** - allow users to explore data and insights.\n",
        "- **Reproducible** - analyses should be reproducible by other teams using the same datasets and methods.\n",
        "- **Automated Data Pipelines** - automate data collection, cleaning, and reporting to ensure consistent updates.\n",
        "- **Versioning and Traceability** - track all changes to data, code, and reports to ensure they can be replicated or rolled back.\n",
        "- **Open source** - use open-source tools and libraries to ensure transparency and collaboration.\n",
        "- **Example** - [MD Demo business model](https://forensis.shinyapps.io/dawetrest/){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# Thank You\n"
      ],
